meta {
  name: Get Related Products (Top-Level)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/related-products?account_id=6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c&_page_size=5
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
  Accept: application/json
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isArray
}

docs {
  Confirmed live 2026-09-15 against "David's Dev Account". Brand-new
  top-level search endpoint in the 2026-09-15 `openapi_pimv3.json`
  refresh, covering the individual `{product_id, related_product_id,
  quantity, last_modified}` link records (the `RelatedProduct` model) --
  a flatter, per-pair view than `/product-relationships`, which groups by
  `relationship_id`/`product_id` without naming the related product(s).

  ## Critical finding -- NOT account-scoped by default (third of three)
  `GET /related-products?_page_size=3` with no filter returned records
  with `account_id: "5da70dd81f44e030456efd2b"` -- explicitly **not**
  "David's Dev Account" (`6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c`), visible directly in
  the response body since (unlike the other two leaking endpoints) this
  one happens to echo `account_id` per record. This is the third of three
  brand-new top-level search endpoints in this refresh confirmed to leak
  cross-tenant data by default -- see `config/api-testing.config.md`'s
  quirk for the full three-endpoint pattern and the recommendation to
  report it to Plytix as a likely data-isolation bug.

  **Workaround**: filter with `?account_id=<id>` or `?product_id=<id>`
  (both confirmed correctly scoped, and both used across this file's
  examples).

  ## Real bug: filtering by `relationship_id` 500s (not just times out)
  Unlike `/product-relationships` (which times out, `504`, on a
  `relationship_id` filter), this endpoint instead 500s immediately:
  `{"errors":[{"name":"HiddenFieldError","description":"Field
  'relationship_id' does not exist in model 'RelatedProduct'."}]}` -- a
  genuine bug, since an internal field-validation error is leaking out as
  a raw `500` instead of being caught and returned as a `400`/`422` like
  every other "field doesn't exist" case in this project (e.g. quirk
  #12's `HiddenFieldError` on products correctly returns `400`). Confirms
  the `RelatedProduct` model genuinely has no `relationship_id` field --
  use `/product-relationships` instead when relationship type matters.
}

example {
  name: Get Related Products - Filtered by account_id (Safe/Scoped)
  description: Real response captured 2026-09-15, filtered to "David's Dev Account" -- shows real relationship data for the kept fixture product `BAG-10157` (id `6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a06`).

  request: {
    url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/related-products?account_id=6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c&_page_size=5
    method: get
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }
    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "data": [
            {"product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a06", "account_id": "6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c", "related_product_id": "6a38f615c3d65a5f868b1a1a", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2025-02-26T14:45:06.971000"},
            {"product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a06", "account_id": "6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c", "related_product_id": "6a38f615c3d65a5f868b1a1b", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2025-02-26T14:45:06.971000"},
            {"product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a07", "account_id": "6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c", "related_product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a11", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2025-03-13T14:15:55.826000"},
            {"product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a07", "account_id": "6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c", "related_product_id": "6a38f615c3d65a5f868b1a1d", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2025-02-26T14:45:07.525000"},
            {"product_id": "6a38f614c3d65a5f868b1a07", "account_id": "6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c", "related_product_id": "6a38f615c3d65a5f868b1a1c", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2025-02-26T14:45:07.525000"}
          ],
          "errors": [],
          "pagination": {
            "next_page": "http://pim.dev.plytix.com/api/v3/related-products?account_id=6a38f5a5b22478f30bfd755c&_page_size=5&_page=2"
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}

example {
  name: Get Related Products - No Filter (Cross-Tenant Data Leak, Bug)
  description: Real response captured 2026-09-15 with NO account filter applied -- account_id in every record is a different, real Plytix account, not "David's Dev Account".

  request: {
    url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/related-products?_page_size=3
    method: get
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }
    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "data": [
            {"product_id": "5e2ac61866bc1da6674d2e4a", "account_id": "5da70dd81f44e030456efd2b", "related_product_id": "5e2ac60c66bc1da6674d2e3a", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2020-01-28T14:28:58.756000"},
            {"product_id": "5e2ac61866bc1da6674d2e4a", "account_id": "5da70dd81f44e030456efd2b", "related_product_id": "5e2ac612cb2f253729c1f16a", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2020-01-28T14:28:58.801000"},
            {"product_id": "5e2ac5fa66bc1da6674d2e24", "account_id": "5da70dd81f44e030456efd2b", "related_product_id": "5e2ac64e66bc1da6674d2e6a", "quantity": 1, "last_modified": "2020-01-28T14:28:58.770000"}
          ],
          "errors": [],
          "pagination": {
            "next_page": "http://pim.dev.plytix.com/api/v3/related-products?_page_size=3&_page=2"
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}

example {
  name: Get Related Products - Filtered by relationship_id (500, Bug)
  description: Real response captured 2026-09-15 -- a genuine HiddenFieldError leaking out as a 500 instead of a 400/422.

  request: {
    url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/related-products?relationship_id=6aa97b2ca30ca5945169a23e
    method: get
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    status: {
      code: 500
      text: Internal Server Error
    }
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }
    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "data": [],
          "errors": [
            {
              "name": "HiddenFieldError",
              "description": "Field 'relationship_id' does not exist in model 'RelatedProduct'."
            }
          ]
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}
